  {
   "rating": 11,
   "date": "2006-05-08T22:20:30-05:00",
   "body": "I got this one :)\n\nALl 3 the Kolkar's are at the same place, a bit north of the questgiver.\n\nI found all of mine in a square of like ... 68,43 - 70,50\nThe Scouts were the hardest to find. \n\nTotal time ... it took half an hour maybe. And as 37 Priest I got between 90 - 100XP per kill.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 8,
   "date": "2007-04-02T10:20:30-05:00",
   "body": "&nbsp; &nbsp; The quest is easy enough, just head up the road through the coven to the Kolkar camp. The only problem I had was that [b]A-[/b] A party had wiped the camp previously and there was nothing there, and [b]B-[/b]I had a bit of trouble with the Maulers (they look like some other type of guy you don't need).\n&nbsp; &nbsp; The [b]Scouts[/b] predictably, are on the fringes and outermost parts of the camp; the [b]Centaur[/b] are more buff and are scattered amung the Scouts; and the [b]Maulers[/b] are towards the inner part of the camp, looking alike to the Centaur in appearance.\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (PS: All the guys you want run away at low HP levels.)",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
